<view class="page-container"><view class="background-gradient"></view><view class="nav-bar"><view class="nav-brand"><view class="brand-icon">🤖</view><view class="brand-info"><text class="brand-name">AI面试助手</text><text class="brand-subtitle">你的专属求职顾问</text></view></view><view class="nav-actions"><view class="nav-action" bindtap="{{a}}"><text class="action-icon">👤</text></view></view></view><scroll-view class="content-wrapper" scroll-y><view class="hero-section"><view class="welcome-card glass-card"><view class="welcome-header"><text class="welcome-greeting">{{b}}</text><view class="welcome-badge"><text class="badge-text">今日已练习 {{c}} 次</text></view></view><text class="welcome-title">准备好拿下心仪的Offer了吗？</text><text class="welcome-subtitle">AI陪你一起，面试不再紧张</text></view><view class="slogan-section"><text class="slogan-emoji">🚀</text><text class="slogan-title">AI智能求职助手</text><text class="slogan-subtitle">模拟真实面试，提升你的Offer成功率</text></view><view class="daily-tip glass-card"><view class="tip-icon">💡</view><view class="tip-content"><text class="tip-label">今日面试建议</text><text class="tip-text">{{d}}</text></view><view class="tip-refresh" bindtap="{{e}}"><text class="refresh-icon">🔄</text></view></view></view><view class="quick-actions"><view class="action-card primary" bindtap="{{f}}"><view class="action-icon-wrap primary"><text class="action-emoji">🎯</text></view><view class="action-info"><text class="action-title">快速开始面试</text><text class="action-desc">立即进入AI面试模式</text></view><view class="action-arrow"><text class="arrow">→</text></view></view><view class="action-card secondary" bindtap="{{g}}"><view class="action-icon-wrap secondary"><text class="action-emoji">🎨</text></view><view class="action-info"><text class="action-title">选择面试模式</text><text class="action-desc">国企/外企/大厂/应届生/压力面试</text></view><view class="action-arrow"><text class="arrow">→</text></view></view></view><view class="features-section"><view class="section-header"><text class="section-title">核心功能</text><text class="section-desc">全方位提升你的面试能力</text></view><view class="features-grid"><view class="feature-card glass-card" bindtap="{{h}}"><view class="feature-icon-wrap"><text class="feature-icon">💼</text></view><text class="feature-name">模拟面试</text><text class="feature-desc">AI一对一面试练习</text></view><view class="feature-card glass-card" bindtap="{{i}}"><view class="feature-icon-wrap"><text class="feature-icon">📄</text></view><text class="feature-name">简历分析</text><text class="feature-desc">智能分析简历优化</text></view><view class="feature-card glass-card" bindtap="{{j}}"><view class="feature-icon-wrap"><text class="feature-icon">📊</text></view><text class="feature-name">面试评分</text><text class="feature-desc">多维度专业评价</text></view><view class="feature-card glass-card" bindtap="{{k}}"><view class="feature-icon-wrap"><text class="feature-icon">🏆</text></view><text class="feature-name">学习记录</text><text class="feature-desc">追踪你的进步</text></view></view></view><view class="stats-section"><view class="stats-card glass-card"><view class="stats-header"><text class="stats-title">我的面试数据</text><text class="stats-update">{{l}}</text></view><view class="stats-content"><view class="stat-item"><text class="stat-value">{{m}}</text><text class="stat-label">模拟面试</text></view><view class="stat-divider"></view><view class="stat-item"><text class="stat-value">{{n}}</text><text class="stat-label">平均评分</text></view><view class="stat-divider"></view><view class="stat-item"><text class="stat-value">{{o}}</text><text class="stat-label">已获Offer</text></view></view></view></view><view class="motivation-section"><view class="motivation-card glass-card"><view class="motivation-icon">{{p}}</view><view class="motivation-content"><text class="motivation-title">{{q}}</text><text class="motivation-text">{{r}}</text></view><view class="motivation-progress"><view class="progress-bar"><view class="progress-fill" style="{{'width:' + s}}"></view></view><text class="progress-text">今日目标: {{t}}%</text></view></view></view><view class="recent-section"><view class="section-header"><text class="section-title">最近练习</text><text class="section-more" bindtap="{{v}}">查看全部</text></view><view class="recent-list"><view wx:for="{{w}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="f" class="recent-item glass-card" bindtap="{{item.g}}"><view class="recent-icon">{{item.a}}</view><view class="recent-info"><text class="recent-title">{{item.b}}</text><text class="recent-time">{{item.c}}</text></view><view class="{{['recent-score', item.e]}}"><text class="score-num">{{item.d}}</text></view></view></view></view><view class="footer-space"></view></scroll-view></view>